ds_list_add(textList, "This is the Mallet used in the Grand Underground beneath the Sinnoh Region.", "Heroic Pokémon trainers courageously used them to dig for Spheres, Shards, and other prizes buried beneath the Earth.", "Some people claim it's reckless, because they're more destructive than other tools and you risk blowing yourself up.", "COWARDS!!", "The Mallet's ALWAYS the way to go.")